 "title": "Headless Bleed Me Dry (VMS38): Red Lucy's six egg hunts for the Thorn, from her hire (10) to the deathclaw eggs (130)",
 "given": [],
 "actions": [
  {
   "op": "note",
   "text": "Path: Red Lucy at the Thorn hires the player (10) and sends them for six clutches of eggs in turn: giant mantis, radscorpion, fire gecko, night stalker, cazador, deathclaw. Each clutch is the quest nest the stage enables (VPit*EggsREF), whose OnActivate gives the clutch and sets the 'return' stage (20, 40 ... 120); handing it over sets the reward stage (25, 45 ... 125) and the next hire the next egg stage. Deathclaw eggs handed over: 125, then 130 (Complete Quest)."
  },
  {
   "op": "note",
   "text": "Stand-in for the skills: Barter and Speech 100 (Lucy's better-pay checks)."
